  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "The introductory calculus on the syllabus: evaluating limits and differentiating with the basic rules.",
          "ar": "مبادئ التفاضل والتكامل في المنهج: حساب النهايات والاشتقاق باستخدام القواعد الأساسية."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Differentiation",
          "ar": "▲ مرجع — الاشتقاق"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}x^{n}=nx^{n-1} \\); the derivative gives the slope of the tangent. Useful derivatives: \\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\sin x=\\cos x \\), \\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}e^{x}=e^{x} \\). A limit of the form \\( \\tfrac00 \\) often factors and cancels.",
          "ar": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}x^{n}=nx^{n-1} \\)؛ وتُعطي المشتقة ميل المماس. مشتقات مفيدة: \\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\sin x=\\cos x \\)، \\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}e^{x}=e^{x} \\). غالبًا ما تُحلَّل نهاية على الصورة \\( \\tfrac00 \\) ويُحذف العامل المشترك."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "The derivative is a limit of slopes. Shrink \\( h \\) below: the secant through \\( (1,1) \\) and \\( (1+h,(1+h)^2) \\) rotates toward the tangent, and its slope approaches \\( f'(1)=2 \\).",
          "ar": "المشتقة هي نهاية للميول. صغّر \\( h \\) أدناه: يدور القاطع المار بـ\\( (1,1) \\) و\\( (1+h,(1+h)^2) \\) نحو المماس، ويقترب ميله من \\( f'(1)=2 \\)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · Secant → tangent",
          "ar": "⊙ مستكشف · من القاطع إلى المماس"
        },
        "canvasId": "tahDerivCanvas",
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "A secant line on y equals x squared approaching the tangent as h shrinks",
          "ar": "خط قاطع على y تساوي x تربيع يقترب من المماس مع تصاغر h"
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "tahDerivDataBtn",
          "panelId": "tahDerivDataPanel",
          "descId": "tahDerivDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "tahDerivDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "Sampled points on f(x) = x²",
            "ar": "نقاط معايَنة على f(x) = x²"
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "f(x)",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "tahDh",
            "valueDisplayId": "tahDhV",
            "label": {
              "en": "Step <b>h =</b>",
              "ar": "الخطوة <b>h =</b>"
            },
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Step h",
              "ar": "الخطوة h"
            },
            "min": 0.1,
            "max": 3,
            "value": 2,
            "step": 0.1
          }
        ],
        "readouts": [
          {
            "id": "tahSecSlope",
            "label": {
              "en": "secant slope",
              "ar": "ميل القاطع"
            },
            "colorClass": "indigo",
            "value": "—"
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "The secant slope is \\( 2+h \\); as \\( h\\to0 \\) it tends to the tangent slope \\( 2 \\) (the dashed grey line).",
          "ar": "ميل القاطع هو \\( 2+h \\)؛ وعندما \\( h\\to0 \\) يؤول إلى ميل المماس \\( 2 \\) (الخط الرمادي المتقطع)."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Power rule",
              "ar": "قاعدة القوة"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}x^{n}=nx^{n-1} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Sine",
              "ar": "الجيب"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}\\sin x=\\cos x \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Exponential",
              "ar": "الأسية"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{d}{dx}e^{x}=e^{x} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Tangent slope",
              "ar": "ميل المماس"
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( f'(a) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 6.A",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 6.أ"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Evaluate \\( \\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to3}\\frac{x^{2}-9}{x-3} \\). \\[ \\lim_{x\\to3}(x+3)=6. \\]",
          "ar": "احسب \\( \\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to3}\\frac{x^{2}-9}{x-3} \\). \\[ \\lim_{x\\to3}(x+3)=6. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 6.B",
          "ar": "مثال محلول 6.ب"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Differentiate \\( 5x^{2}-2x \\). \\[ 10x-2. \\]",
          "ar": "اشتق \\( 5x^{2}-2x \\). \\[ 10x-2. \\]"
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "warn",
        "label": {
          "en": "Practice Problem",
          "ar": "سؤال تدريبي"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Find \\(\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\) for \\(y=(3x^2+1)^4\\) using the chain rule, then find the slope of the tangent at \\(x=1.\\) <details><summary>Show solution</summary><div>Chain rule: \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=4(3x^2+1)^3\\cdot6x=24x(3x^2+1)^3.\\) At \\(x=1\\): \\(24(1)(3+1)^3=24\\cdot64=1536.\\)</div></details>",
          "ar": "أوجد \\(\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\) لـ \\(y=(3x^2+1)^4\\) باستخدام قاعدة السلسلة، ثم أوجد ميل المماس عند \\(x=1.\\) <details><summary>عرض الحل</summary><div>قاعدة السلسلة: \\(\\frac{dy}{dx}=4(3x^2+1)^3\\cdot6x=24x(3x^2+1)^3.\\) عند \\(x=1\\): \\(24(1)(3+1)^3=24\\cdot64=1536.\\)</div></details>"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
